# ─── Slesh raw exports (PII — never commit) ─────────────────────────
# Raw Slesh exports contain customer names, emails, IBANs — never commit.
# Curated extracts via Cowork are PII-stripped (no names, emails, user IDs,
# wristband tags) and ARE committed under data/sundance-{year}/ for
# version control + cross-session reproducibility.
data/*
!data/sundance-2023/
!data/sundance-2024/
!data/sundance-2025/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.bak
backups/

